<DocsExample TExample="SplitButtonBasicExample" Title="Primary action with a menu" Description="The leading segment runs OnClickCallback, while the trailing segment opens the menu items. At least one menu item is required." />
<DocsExample TExample="SplitButtonVariantsExample" Title="Variants and sizes" Description="Variant and ButtonSize apply to both segments. Elevation is managed automatically per variant." />
<DocsExample TExample="SplitButtonExpandedExample" Title="Tracking the menu" Description="Bind Expanded to know whether the menu is open. CloseOnMenuContentClick closes it after a choice." />
<DocsExample TExample="SplitButtonDisabledExample" Title="Disabled states" Description="Disabled turns off both segments, while MenuButtonDisabled disables only the trailing menu." />
